---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, '/');
---
<Layout title="About" description="About Naman Patel, the person behind Naman.blog, SmallMB, and a growing collection of useful little tools.">
  <div class="quiet-page">
    <header class="quiet-page-header"><h1>About me</h1><p>I’m Naman, from Mandla, India. I build useful little things and write when I have something worth keeping.</p></header>
    <div class="about-story">
      <p>I first learned the web through blogging and SEO: choosing a subject, publishing it, watching what people searched for, and fixing pages that were not doing their job.</p>
      <p>Later, I kept wanting small tools that either did not exist or made simple jobs unnecessarily complicated. Learning to build them felt like the sensible next step.</p>
      <p>Now I work on <a href="https://smallmb.com/">SmallMB</a>, an Android app for everyday photo and PDF tasks; <a href="https://github.com/namanlabc/astro-seo-audit">Astro SEO Audit</a>, an open-source site checker; and a few browser tools that began with one spinning wheel.</p>
      <p>I am mostly self-taught. My usual method is to make something, use it, notice what is annoying, and go back to the code. Very scientific.</p>
      <h2>Away from the code</h2>
      <p>I’m writing a long fantasy novel, reading manga, watching <em>One Piece</em>, and drinking chai. Not everything here needs to become a product.</p>
      <p>This site keeps the whole mix together: <a href={`${base}projects/`}>projects</a>, <a href={`${base}experience/`}>experience</a>, and <a href={`${base}archive/`}>notes</a>. I’m also on <a href="https://github.com/namanlabc/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a> and <a href="https://x.com/namanlabs" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">X</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
